  category IO_OPERATION
  verb en write|save|store|persist|dump|flush|commit|serialize to|record|output|export|publish data|append to|sync to disk
  verb pt escrever|escrita|gravar|gravacao|salvar|armazenar|persistir|despejar|exportar|exportacao|publicar|confirmar gravacao
  pattern en write_*
  pattern en save_*
  pattern en store_*
  pattern en persist_*
  pattern en dump_*
  pattern en flush_*
  pattern en export_*
  antonym READ
end
